       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. RDOFFSETREAD.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 P PIC X(8) VALUE 'LEFTNEXT'.
       01 Q PIC X(4).
       01 OFFS PIC 9.
       01 SEL PIC 9.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       ACCEPT SEL.
       IF SEL = 1 MOVE 1 TO OFFS ELSE MOVE 5 TO OFFS END-IF.
       MOVE P(OFFS:4) TO Q.
       CALL Q.
       GOBACK.
